        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>8-3/4 Inch Square Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 8-3/4\" square handle is perfect for smaller doors such as pantry doors, large cabinets and interior doors. It is available in  brushed nickel, polished chrome and oil rubbed bronze finishes to fit any decor; but it is the sharp, clean lines of this square door handle that give it a modern feel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern door handle is made out of <b>3/4\" diameter</b> square  tubing. It has a 8\" center to center mounting (distance between the 2 mounting screws). For use on doors made of wood, metal or composites (such as fiberglass). \r\n<br>\r\nFor glass doors use <a href=\"/products/8-inch-center-to-center-square-back-to-back-pulls-pair-sdq-800\"><b>8\" Square Shower Door Handles</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-720-ecb.jpg?v=1704354596\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"8-3/4 Inch Square Handle Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/6-3-4-inch-square-handle\"><b>6-3/4\" Square Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the 8-3/4 Inch Square Handle Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\" (19 mm) Square Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
